es with slope. Similar","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to GDAL’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gdaldem"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-combined"},{"text":" option.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"igor"},{"text":": Hillshade algorithm which tries to minimize effects on other map","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"features beneath. Similar to GDAL’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"gdaldem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"-igor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" option."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"multidirectional","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": Hillshade with multiple illumination directions. Uses","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the basic hillshade model with multiple independent light sources."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Predefined functions, including mathematical and string operators"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Conditional expressions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Variable assignments and references to assigned variables"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Step functions applied to the "},{"code":"$zoomLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" variable"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property does not support applying interpolation functions to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"$zoomLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" variable or applying interpolation or step functions to feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attributes."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The hillshade algorithm to use, one of ","type":"text"},{"code":"MLNHillshadeMethodStandard","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MLNHillshadeMethodBasic"},{"text":", ",